# Where the website's "Sign in" links lead (the account dashboard's origin).
# Leave this unset to link to the official UltraSync dashboard,
# https://app.ultratasks.app. Set it to an empty value to hide the links, or to
# another HTTPS origin (loopback HTTP is allowed for development). An invalid
# value is ignored with a warning and the official dashboard is used.
# PUBLIC_ACCOUNT_URL=
